Hi Bob,

I hope I'm not missing the point here, but why not keep the original
data.frame intact throughout the whole process? Doesn't

my_data2 <- ddply(my_data, "group", function(DF) {
    m <- lm(y ~ x, data=DF)
    DF$resid <- resid(m)
    DF$fitted <- predict(m)
    return(DF)
})

accomplish your goal?

Best,
Ista

