    x         y group       resid    fitted
1   1  3.611557     A  0.26380725  3.347750
2   3  4.349679     A -0.35210563  4.701785
3   5  6.183538     A  0.12771733  6.055821
4   7  7.155509     A -0.25434676  7.409856
5   9  8.978819     A  0.21492781  8.763891
